msgstr ""
"Ledgers retain B0–B6 and original exit conditions, adding "
"implementation_paths/evidence_paths, software_status and hardware_status. "
"Implemented means mechanisms exist, not every exit passed. Development "
"cannot replace clean-source SDKs, formal offline dual builds or candidate "
"sealing. Formal NG028/030 executions update freshly generated evidence. "
"Hardware is disconnected and all applicable physical items are not_executed."
" Glob denotes explicit directory families of one mechanism, not recursive "
"discovery or default builds; X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples paths belong to a "
"separate repository."

msgid ""
"CPU 软件层覆盖 M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85，通过显式 CPU/IRQ facts 选择原子后端、ABI、可选 "
"FPU/MVE/cache/MPU/SAU 与裸机/FreeRTOS port。外部 CPU runtime 不生成 "
"SoC/Board/factory；ThreadX 另有明确的 Native/M4 子集，不能继承 九核 FreeRTOS port "
"范围。配置示例与剩余条件见 [九核支持说明](../delivery/cortex-m.md)。这不扩大完整平台的芯片/板卡范围。"
msgstr ""
"CPU software covers M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85, selecting atomic "
"backends, ABI, optional FPU/MVE/cache/MPU/SAU and baremetal/FreeRTOS ports "
"through explicit CPU/IRQ facts. External CPU runtime generates no "
"SoC/Board/factory. ThreadX maintains a separate explicit Native/M4 subset "
"and inherits no nine-core FreeRTOS scope. See [nine-core "
"support](../delivery/cortex-m.md) for configurations and outstanding "
"conditions. This does not expand whole-platform chip/board scope."

msgid ""
"首发为启明STM32F407ZGT6、天空星STM32F407VET6和梁山派GD32F470ZGT6，裸机/ FreeRTOS、显式 ThreadX "
"及 Native 模型。新增 F103RBT6／GD32F303RCT6 参考及 G474／H743／U575 增量按各文档的精确配置、完整镜像与 "
"SDK 退出条件验收，不从公共 类型推断完整系列或全部外设。F103/GD303 增加有限 UART channel-DMA、I2C IRQ、 物理 "
"Flash、单次 ADC 与固定 PWM；GD303 另维护 EXTI 和硬件级联 timebase。 G474 的既有 "
"GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/IWDG/EXTI 之外，选入 bulb ADC 单次／有限 TIM6 DMA、I2C1 和 ECC "
"Flash。H743 的固定 HSI/cache 支持有限 TX DMA 或有 rearm 间隙的 RX block，可显式初始化 D2 "
"SRAM1；另有七类有限外设的软件夹具。U575 TZEN0 增加 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash，外部电源与安全状态准入仍适用。"
" 独立无 OS 的 TZEN1 GPIO 参考可复制最多八条命令到 Secure slot，再由调用者逐步 推进；不保留 NS 指针，不代表通用双域 "
"factory、NS RTOS 或异步借用。 ECC `program_flags`、fresh-erase 来源与逐脉冲完成责任见公共 Flash "
"合同；当前源 实现和最终集成资格分别记录，不继承历史执行计数。 SOC-33–35 仍未实现；SOC-36 保留 partial，SOC-37–55 "
"的物理验收仍为 not_executed。 三Board未审实物PCB事实仍标unknown；软件测试夹具不升格真实 "
"Board路线。角色沿用十人配置：TL1、Core/I/O/OS2、BSP2、通用应用/通信2、QA/HIL2、 "
"构建发布1；维护责任由Codex全部承担，无需实名人员。远程branch protection状态 须通过GitHub独立核实，不能从本地角色文件推断。"
msgstr ""
"First-release references are Qiming STM32F407ZGT6, Sky STM32F407VET6 and "
"Liangshan GD32F470ZGT6, with baremetal/FreeRTOS, explicit ThreadX and Native"
" models. New F103RBT6/GD32F303RCT6 references and G474/H743/U575 increments "
"follow each contract's exact configuration, complete-image and SDK exits; "
"public types do not imply whole-family or all-peripheral support. F103/GD303"
" add finite UART channel-DMA, IRQ I2C, physical Flash, single-shot ADC and "
"fixed PWM. GD303 also maintains EXTI and a hardware-cascaded timebase. G474 "
"adds bulb ADC shots/finite TIM6 DMA, I2C1 and ECC Flash beside "
"GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/IWDG/EXTI. H743 fixed HSI/Cache supports finite TX DMA or "
"RX blocks with rearm gaps, explicitly initialized D2 SRAM1 and seven finite "
"peripheral classes in software fixtures. U575 TZEN0 adds "
"SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash with external supply and security-state "
"admission. Its independent no-OS TZEN1 GPIO reference copies up to eight "
"commands into a Secure slot for caller-driven progress; it retains no NS "
"pointer and does not provide a generic dual-world factory, NS RTOS or "
"asynchronous borrow. The public Flash contract owns ECC `program_flags`, "
"fresh-erase provenance and per-pulse completion. Current implementation and "
"final integrated qualification are recorded separately without inherited "
"historical counts. SOC-33–35 remain unimplemented, SOC-36 partial, and "
"SOC-37–55 physical acceptance not_executed. Unobserved PCB facts for the "
"three Boards remain unknown; software fixtures do not become actual Board "
"routes. The ten-person capacity model remains TL1, Core/I/O/OS2, BSP2, "
"common applications/communications2, QA/HIL2 and build/release1. Codex owns "
"all maintenance without requiring named accounts. Remote branch protection "
"must be independently observed through GitHub rather than inferred from "
"local role files."

msgid ""
"行为变更采用 RED → GREEN → REFACTOR；主机 GoogleTest/GoogleMock 测试真实生产 "
"provider、factory 与 owner，配置工具用 Python unittest。commit hook 和 CI 执行同一 门禁，生产 "
"MCU target 不链接测试框架。构建期资源验证、实际寄存器模型、ARM ELF 预算与物理 HIL 分别建立证据，方法表开销由实际 linked "
"image 测量。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior changes follow RED → GREEN → REFACTOR. Host GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"tests execute real providers, factories and owners; configuration tools use "
"Python unittest. Commit hooks and CI run the same gate; MCU targets link no "
"test frameworks. Build-time resources, actual register models, ARM ELF "
"budgets and physical HIL establish separate evidence; actual linked images "
"measure method-table overhead."

